<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-23T18:32:45.494Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 18:32:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have intensified missile and drone attacks on Saudi Arabia, striking Riyadh, Khamis Mushait and Dammam airport, where a missile killed two people and injured eight. The Saudi-led coalition continues to intercept these weapons, downing missiles over Saudi territory and repelling overnight attack waves on Saudi targets. Yemeni forces reported over a thousand strikes on Houthi positions in a single day, showing heightened counter-offensive activity. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNam5fbUtVVmJNM0NOWkRRR0pjODJIaURCbVVsNUtpekk1YjFHYmRYR05fSi01R1hLRFFhTVZHODVUX05Hb3B6Z25ZVjZIUjBNYUItWUY0TUNyTlhlVExGOFZLbGRhSEpockxHc3M2NUx0RGZ3STBIem54OFVyZWJDZmIxT1QyTDJibEpVb1hLc1owYlRnWEFKdHgwTjg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNSGNWYThfTTlBMk0yXzZJMVdvRkp2NDRwOEItSlJxRjN3NE5nVmRMbFkybld2UUFLWHFzel8zTEVMMUt4T3A3QUxMN0dObTR6WHMwOHUwYmh2RGJYX1hIOFBSb1ppQ0VIUW0xdTFzTHB2NENTTElkMTRqOHBVWGFoejRhb3dhclZtS09kNkZra055RUlyVm82M1ZpNmhHZWctLUtfelg5blVrbW5aVHhpSzBvVmsyNVZm?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPQU1tUTNWUUhwRTREbkc0VjRsVzhzS3AxQ3o3elNwaVotYzhFVE9ZeDFaZzZPbFpwSlJzRFljRkxQOW04M3VPd2VObXFzTnRtWW0taV9aOTFXZVRuSllNREwzWURCOWZNSW9nWEUyZTBOTmRuelhlTVI3d3dTRjF6NUU0ZElJVTdfd3BDNkhHYy12MUxNVFVDdFl3QWVmTkNKeW5xeEZ3b21uLVZpNTVFTVFjNGRWNXlWMEZv?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPR2dZUC10TmJYRUk2RmM5WWpxaUx2XzBPZ0ZTV3hIR3BkaGFvZ3B2T1hhd0xEcXZOWk5LdXhLLUF5QU9XdTRQdnRyTk9jcmVNMEZvZlZBRW8xcG1TVW1fTkY2UnFrcXlVWlUwbDhRYk9pcW1fdEdzMVNRR2ZhYVl2T0RZa09uZTktZGFWRVRWSEpGeFhYVXVPR09zNDVaTVdiNDdRRHg3VFNyZW